%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a function-based shading with a sampled function from a
% string. A type 0 function of two inputs and three outputs holds four
% RGB samples at eight bits in a string, one per corner of the unit
% domain, and the shading's Matrix maps that domain onto a rectangle:
% the viewer interpolates the corners across it.
<< /ShadingType 1 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB
   /Matrix [200 0 0 100 100 500]
   /Function << /FunctionType 0 /Domain [0 1 0 1] /Range [0 1 0 1 0 1]
     /Size [2 2] /BitsPerSample 8
     /DataSource <ff0000 00ff00 0000ff ffff00> >> >> shfill
showpage
